compose-swing-ui :: swing-ui-animation

This module contains source code copied and adapted from the Android Open Source
Project's Jetpack Compose animation library, redistributed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

  Original: androidx.compose.animation:animation 1.13.0
            (AndroidX commit ac6d2ce3d991b07d9b981d616bddc6d3ab461eab)
  Copyright The Android Open Source Project

Adaptations: the code lays out, places and paints through this project's Swing
layout and decoration mechanisms, without its lookahead and shared-element parts,
and with java.awt types in place of Compose's geometry and color types. A deferred
transition's handoff carries only the offset velocity its caller supplies, where
the original also measures the scale and offset velocities itself.
